                                "sense_id": "48ccba92-67d3-35d8-84b3-a0f524a93934",
                                "text": "“Pardy,” return’d the king, “but still / My joints are somewhat stiff or so. / My lord, and shall we pass the bill / I mention’d half an hour ago?”"
